<title>PHILIPPINES: Empire East Q1 net up at 349.2 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Empire East Q1 net up at 349.2 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empire East Land Holdings Inc said on Wednesday its net income rose by 16 percent to 349.2 million pesos in the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>The company registered a 301.3 million net income in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
